  "action": "explore",
  "question": "Does automatic exit from an implicit joint configuration resume after a failed leadership transfer when subsequent Ready/Advance cycles contain only heartbeats, and does an ordinary applied proposal restore the retry?",
  "rationale": "The public ConfChangeTransitionJointImplicit contract assigns automatic exit to Raft. raft.appliedTo retries through MsgProp, which is dropped during transfer. tickHeartbeat aborts transfer without retrying; RawNode only emits application acknowledgments for nonempty committed batches. This controlled public-API history compares no-transfer and failed-transfer cases, observes 30 ticks with all other messages delivered, then supplies a new ordinary proposal as a discriminator. No permanent liveness or formal defect verdict is asserted before retained execution.",
